<%# Handoff 0070 -- a "공개 예정" card: a titled draft episode of the same product, listed after the published
    cards so the season reads whole (D-008). Deliberately a <div>, never a link -- no href, no CTA, not focusable
    or clickable -- because the episode's body/URL is still gated exactly as before (404 on direct access; this
    card never claims otherwise). Same one-row layout as the customer's published card (0067: the title on the
    left, no episode number, a fixed label on the right that's forced to its own line below `sm`) so the season
    reads as one continuous list, just muted (gray, lower opacity) to read as "not yet". %>
<div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-4 opacity-60">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
    <span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate font-semibold text-gray-500" title="<%= episode.customer_title %>"><%= episode.customer_title %></span>
    <span class="order-last w-full shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-semibold text-gray-400 sm:order-none sm:ml-auto sm:w-auto">공개 예정</span>
  </div>
  <% if episode.summary.present? %>
    <p class="mt-1 truncate text-sm text-gray-400" title="<%= episode.summary %>"><%= episode.summary %></p>
  <% end %>
</div>
